  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: xrviz::InterludeInstructionsDisplay
  uiDocument: {fileID: 1770000004}
  instructionsText: 'Plan a path for the robot. Place the robot''s start position
    such that the end effector (wrist) is within the green region. Place the robot''s
    goal position such that the end effector (wrist) is within the orange region.
    Then, send a planning request using the Planning Request Menu. Once inspecting
    the path, press the menu button to indicate it is collision-free.


    Press
    ''B'' on the Right Hand Controller when finished with this scene to advance to
    the next.


    Press ''A'' on the Right Hand Controller to go back to the previous
    scene if needed.'
